um=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"UGREEN 40Gbps USB4 M.2 NVMe SSD enclosure aluminum fin heatsink CM642\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n2\\. UGREEN 40Gbps NVMe Enclosure\n\n(Best value)\n\nGood performance and effective passive cooling at a lower price than many premium alternatives. Tom's Hardware selected it as its best USB4/Thunderbolt enclosure.\n\n\ue200url\ue202Read independent review\ue202https://www.tomshardware.com/best-picks/best-ssd-and-hard-drive-enclosures\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"ACASIS TBU406 Pro USB4 40Gbps NVMe enclosure aluminum fin cooling\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn559903product2\",\"ACASIS TBU406 Pro\"]\ue201\n\n(Best fanless alternative)\n\n## \\$79.00\n\nDeep-fin aluminum cooling, silent operation, and Intel JHL7440 controller. Particularly interesting for Thunderbolt compatibility.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.acasis.com/products/acasis-40gbps-usb4-m-2-nvme-enclosure-with-aluminum-fin-cooling?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=49093588287717&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Satechi USB4 NVMe SSD Pro Enclosure 40Gbps product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn559903product27\",\"Satechi USB4 NVMe SSD Pro\"]\ue201\n\n## \\$119.99\n\nTool-free installation, supports several M.2 sizes, and advertises up to 3,840 MB/s. Check SSD thickness compatibility.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://satechi.com/products/usb4-nvme-ssd-pro-enclosure?utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\nTom's Hardware found the UGREEN competitive in performance and cooling, while the OWC ran cool but carried a price premium. \ue200cite\ue202turn559903search9\ue202turn559903search0\ue201\n\n## What matters most when choosing\n\n| Feature | What to look for |\n|--------|--------|\n| Controller | ASMedia ASM2464PD for high USB4 throughput; Intel JHL7440 for Thunderbolt-oriented compatibility |\n| Cooling | Large aluminum heatsink or fan for long transfers |\n| Sustained writes | Independent 100\u2013500GB transfer tests, not just peak benchmarks |\n| SSD compatibility | M.2 2280 NVMe, with double-sided support if needed |\n| Cable | Included certified or rated |"}],"c":14}   

